# ==========================================================
# ResilientVisionAutonomous — unified ignore policy
# Covers the original attack/detection pipeline and the
# imported CNN detection pipeline (src/, configs/, run.py).
# Datasets, generated outputs and model weights stay on disk
# but are never tracked by Git.
# ==========================================================

# ---- Local datasets and raw data (both pipelines) ----
datasets/
data/

# ---- Generated outputs (dataset generators, experiments) ----
outputs/
results/
logs/
test_output/

# ---- Model checkpoints and weights ----
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.engine

# ---- Other large generated artifacts ----
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
*.rar

# ---- Python bytecode and tooling caches ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# ---- Notebook checkpoints ----
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- Environments ----
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.conda/
conda-env/
conda-meta/

# ---- IDEs and operating systems ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
